    "solution": "（a）22.2 °C。（b）$\\Delta T({}^\\circ\\text{F}) = T_2({}^\\circ\\text{F}) - T_1({}^\\circ\\text{F}) = \\frac{9}{5}T_2({}^\\circ\\text{C}) + 32.0^\\circ - \\left(\\frac{9}{5}T_1({}^\\circ\\text{C}) + 32.0^\\circ\\right) = \\frac{9}{5}\\left(T_2({}^\\circ\\text{C}) - T_1({}^\\circ\\text{C})\\right) = \\frac{9}{5}\\Delta T({}^\\circ\\text{C})$"
   }
